  "changelog": {
    "url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.67.0",
    "text": "## What's Changed\n* Changelog for v0.65.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29853\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.67.0-nightly.20261020.gb041de017 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29854\n* Changelog for v0.66.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29852\n* feat(cli): bridge the IDE companion into container sandboxes over exec stdio by @elberthc-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29858\n* fix(core): prevent duplicate agent loading when workspace is home directory (#27692) by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29847\n* fix(ide): exclude IDE settings and GEMINI.md files from open file con text by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29848\n* fix(core): scope untrusted flag checks to external output and remember approved flags by @luisfelipe-alt in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29833\n* fix(a2a-server): mount express.json() before A2A SDK route registration by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29850\n* fix(core): adhere to RFC 9110 token rules when splitting custom headers by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29865\n* fix(core): respect read-only files and hard links in atomic writeTextFile by @elberthc-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29749\n* fix(a2a-server,core): preserve extended token usage metadata and align per-turn reporting by @jvargassanchez-dot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29834\n* fix(core): ensure all model turns with function calls receive thought signatures by @amelidev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29828\n* fix(cli): handle termination signals and prevent tool execution after cancellation in non-interactive mode by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29849\n* fix(cli): preserve ${VAR} placeholders during deprecated settings migration by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29867\n* fix(cli): stop continuation stream processing and auto-nudge after request cancellation by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29868\n* fix(cli): correct Thai and Lao SARA AM display width by @elberthc-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29883\n* fix(core): resolve relative file paths against active IDE workspace root by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29838\n* feat(cli): add models command and --list-models flag for model discovery by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29880\n* fix(cli): convert Claude hook timeout from seconds to milliseconds during migration by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29899\n* fix(core): classify project spending cap errors as terminal quota errors by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29961\n* fix(acp): include MCP server and tool metadata in permission requests by @duvanka-prasad in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29910\n* fix(cli): prevent parent command name insertion on /chat list autocomplete by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29967\n* fix(cli): validate finite numbers in numeric settings editor by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29968\n* fix(core): allow trusted system paths on Android (Termux) for ripgrep resolution (#21836) by @amelidev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29884\n* fix(core): normalize CRLF line endings before diffing in getDiffContextSnippet by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29966\n* fix(cli): handle terminals that render ambiguous-width characters as wide by @elberthc-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29905\n* fix(cli): prevent duplicate history and double telemetry in confirm_action flow by @duvanka-prasad in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29974\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.66.0...v0.67.0"
